{
  "_comment": "GWY-49 reference data (CLAUDE.md \u00a723): the zero-data-retention capability of every provider the gateway can route to. `zdr` is one of none | default | enterprise. EVERY row ships as `none` with `verified_at: null` \u2014 a claim about a third party's data handling is not data until someone has read that provider's policy page and dated it (specs/GWY-49 \u00a79 Q1). A `default`/`enterprise` row MUST carry `policy_url` and `verified_at`; the seed refuses otherwise. Seeded into Neon `provider_capabilities` by apps/web/db/seed.mjs; read by the gateway through its refresher, never per request.",
